### Endpoints

| Método | Ruta | Descripción |
|--------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/character/{id}` | Personaje de Rick & Morty por ID |
| GET | `/pokemon/{name}` | Pokémon por nombre |
| GET | `/combined?char_id={id}&pokemon={name}` | Respuesta combinada |
| GET | `/health` | Estado de breakers |

### Variables de entorno

| Variable | Default | Descripción |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `PORT` | 8080 | Puerto del servidor |
| `RICK_URL` | <https://rickandmortyapi.com/api> | Base Rick API |
| `POKE_URL` | <https://pokeapi.co/api/v2> | Base PokéAPI |
| `HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS` | 3000 | Timeout HTTP externo |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | info | info / debug |
